  "content": "<h1>Tricky Trials 回溯移植</h1><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fopensource.org%252flicenses%252fMIT\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-ff0000.svg\" alt=\"許可證: MIT\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraft.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Minecraft-1.20.1-00a000.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-47.4.10-202c44.svg\" alt=\"Forge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-0.92.7-dbd0b4.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/87ba47ec7aee0b138a2c47fbdac2bfbcdc053cf2_0.webp\" alt=\"Tricky Trials 回溯移植\"></p><p>一個能將 Tricky Trials 體驗帶到 1.20.1 版本的 Minecraft 模組。新增凝灰岩方塊、狼牙棒、風爆彈等等內容。</p><h2>依賴模組</h2><h3>必要</h3><ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-age-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">Copper Age Backport</a>（用於試煉密室中的銅方塊）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trimmed\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trimmed</a>（用於自訂盔甲紋樣）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sherdsapi\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sherds API</a>（用於自訂陶器碎片）</li>\n</ol><h3>可選</h3><ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillabackport\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Backport</a>（用於裝飾陶罐的戰利品表與生怪蛋紋理）</li>\n</ol><h2>製作團隊</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>作者</strong>：Daniel Dixon (Dandi2k8)</li>\n<li><strong>靈感來源</strong>：Minecraft 1.21 更新「Tricky Trials」</li>\n</ul>",
